<title>USA: ADR REPORT - BioChem Pharma rises.</title>
<headline>ADR REPORT - BioChem Pharma rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's BioChem Pharma Inc rose Monday to highlight trade in foreign shares and American Depositary Receipts (ADRs).</p>
<p>Traders said ADRs were largely mirroring the upward trend of the larger New York markets. Trade was quiet in part because the Mexico City and London exchanges were closed for holidays.</p>
<p>&quot;The ADRs are just following New York,&quot; a trader said. &quot;It's very quiet across the board.&quot;</p>
</text>
